  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a time path dream realm, an old man imparts Time Cutting Edge to Fang Yuan. Fang Yuan listens closely as the old man’s explanation continues: because time cutting edge is already time path, other time path killer moves complement it instead of conflicting; if other paths used time path methods to accelerate their killer moves, the effect would backfire. Rather than time cutting edge itself, he starts to learn Shrink Time.",
      "chapters": [
        1596
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_time",
        "move_time_cutting_edge",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shrink Time is a rank six killer move used to supplement time cutting edge. Fang Yuan fails to activate it three times, each injury cutting his soul foundation, then succeeds and grasps the move; he also judges it valuable for other time path killer moves, not only time cutting edge. The version obtained in the dream realm might not be usable in the real world, but he holds the content accurate and expects the light of Wisdom Gu can produce a usable version if there are differences.",
      "chapters": [
        1597
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-practice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan invades Heavenly Court, he uses Heaven Form and adds the time path killer move Shrink Time into it, which lets him rapidly invade the target area.",
      "chapters": [
        1934
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-invasion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "move_heaven_form"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Time cutting edge’s activation time cannot cross three breaths, so Fang Yuan has to use the supplementary killer move Shrink Time every time he activates that move.",
      "chapters": [
        1943
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "every-activation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long treats Fang Yuan’s time path system as covering battle and immortal aperture management, with two trump cards: time cutting edge combined with Shrink Time, and spring autumn success whose core is Spring Autumn Cicada.",
      "chapters": [
        1946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combined-trump-card",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    }
  ],
